root@26d9df2e6bbd:/app# cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'
> IPython Library - Key Functions for Testing
> 
> IPython is an interactive Python shell with advanced features.
> 
> Key Functions and Modules to Test:
> 1. InteractiveShell.run_cell() - Execute Python code in the shell
> 2. InteractiveShell.run_code() - Run compiled code
> 3. InputTransformer2.transform_cell() - Transform input before execution
> 4. Completer.completions() - Code completion
> 5. Completer.complete() - Get completions for a prefix
> 6. PrefilterManager.prefilter() - Preprocess input commands
> 7. PrefilterManager.prefilter_line() - Preprocess a single line
> 8. compilerop.compile() - Compile Python code with custom error handling
> 9. oinspect.Inspector.info() - Inspect Python objects
> 10. oinspect.Inspector.pinfo() - Print object information
> 11. formatters.PlainTextFormatter.format() - Format output
> 12. guarded_eval.eval() - Safely evaluate expressions
> 13. history.HistoryManager.get_tail() - Get history entries
> 14. magic.Magics - Magic command system
> 15. splitinput.split_user_input() - Parse user input
> 
> Fuzzing Focus Areas:
> - Arbitrary Python code execution paths
> - Input transformer edge cases
> - Completion with malformed input
> - Magic command parsing
> - Unicode and special characters in code
> - Nested/recursive code structures
> - Exception handling edge cases
> EOF
